  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 402.02 Approvals Required",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 402.02 Approvals Required. No person shall construct, modify, expand, or enlarge a PWS until all required state and local approvals, including water system design approval pursuant to this chapter, have been obtained.\n\nSource. #14158, eff 12-25-24",
